{
  "$comment": "Reliability tier for each cited source, by domain (first match wins; every cited source must match a rule). Tiers: primary (official/government/statutory), reference (encyclopedias and curated references), secondary (journalism, think tanks, published books), low (forums, social media, fan wikis, quiz/aggregator and document-sharing sites). Edit and re-run extract-pdf to change.",
